  "limitations": [
    "The parametric MPFB exterior remains visibly rendered and is used for spatial exploration. The actual studio photograph supplies observed exterior appearance; the two are not registered and neither is a population-normal template.",
    "The fibroblast and skin micrographs are different prepared specimens; fluorescence/stain colors are not natural tissue colors. Only the skin full-field width is calibrated by its archive.",
    "Secretory itineraries and fusion topology are schematic with presentation time; no molecular geometry, fitted kinetics, coats, retrieval or detailed pore nucleation is modeled.",
    "The consuming sphere and slab use synthetic values, uniform zero-order demand and maintained surface concentration; they are not clinical tissue viability models.",
    "Free-diffusion RMS times do not describe deterministic arrival, first passage or vesicle transport.",
    "Cooper and the original NCBI retroperitoneum pages were available at indexed-excerpt depth during authoring; Blobel–Dobberstein evidence was abstract-level, not a complete scanned-article review.",
    "Source-frame inspection is bounded sampling, not continuous video/audio. Private browser PDF proofs include an installed extension overlay and are not clean public PDF deliverables."
